  "title": "SvelteKit: Prototype pollution in file input deletion path in remote-function forms",
  "summary": "If you use remote form functions, have an input field of type `file`, and accept arbitrary user-controlled path names for the field, then you are vulnerable to a prototype pollution attack where the attacker can remove e.g. methods on the prototype.",
